            <sparkle:version>20261016192356</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.8</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Aki 0.8.8</h2>
<h3>Fixed</h3><ul>
<li>The send arrow in History works again for the Codex and Claude apps: a mark that didn't go is sent again (from the box when it's still there), and one that already went isn't sent twice.</li>
<li>Marks sent to a new Codex conversation are counted as sent: Aki waits a little longer for the message to show.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
