        <item>
            <title>0.8.6</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 12:04:26 -0300</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>20261016150426</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Aki 0.8.6</h2>
<h3>Fixed</h3><ul>
<li>A double-click on a Claude app or Codex app conversation's ring opens that conversation in the app, like an Orca tab.</li>
<li>The marks already with the agent ("1 to do") are always listed on the ring's card; a click opens that session's History, where you can see and resolve each one.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
